## ---- the three later heroes: Kuzma, Ivanushka, Lisa ----

hero-kuzma = Kuzma
hero-kuzma-desc = A smith. At the start of a fight he helps the party and forges his plate: each card with the forge mark played adds 1. At 15 he puts the plate on — 40 durability instead of block — and strikes until it is knocked off.
hero-ivan = Ivanushka the Fool
hero-ivan-desc = The numbers on his cards fall by chance, and each such card gathers Luck. Cards of Luck fall on anyone — a foe or a friend — and burn all the Luck at once.
hero-lisa = Lisa Patrikeevna
hero-lisa-desc = Each turn she draws 4 cards of her own and 1 Borrowed card — a copy of an ally's card. She dodges, charms, flatters, and lays gold by in her Stash.

mech-Forge-name = Forging
mech-Forge = As Kuzma's turn begins, 2 random cards in his hand get the forge mark; the mark lasts only while the card stays in hand. A marked card played adds 1 to the plate, a "Forges N" card adds N. At 15 Kuzma puts on his plate: 40 durability takes blows instead of block, he can gain no block of his own, and no arm can be cut off. Two-sided cards do something else in the plate — more damage. The plate holds until it is knocked to 0; then Kuzma is back at the forge and starts from nothing.
mech-Luck-name = Luck
mech-Luck = The numbers on Ivan's cards fall by chance: on marked cards when the card comes to hand, on blind ones when it is played. Every card with a number played gives 1 Luck. Cards of Luck fall on a random target — a foe or one of the party (alone: a foe or Ivan himself); their power is the Luck, and after them the Luck burns to 0. Evil cards of Luck harm whoever they fall on.
mech-Sly-name = Borrowed Cards
mech-Sly = Each turn Lisa draws 4 cards of her own and 1 Borrowed card — a copy of a random card from an ally's hand (alone: from other heroes' cards). A Borrowed card costs what the original does and is gone once played or when the turn ends; its owner loses nothing. Other heroes' own crafts do nothing in her hands. Lisa lays a share of each fight's gold by in her Stash: it comes back on the next floor with more to it, and on the last floor it becomes Strength.

side-plate-Human = At the forge
side-plate-Beast = In plate

status-Forge = Forging
status-Forge-help = How much Kuzma has forged. At 15 he puts on his plate.
status-Plate = Plate
status-Plate-help = The plate's durability: it takes blows instead of block. While it is on, no block can be gained and no arm cut off. At 0 the plate comes off.
status-Luck = Luck
status-Luck-help = Grows with every card with a number played. Cards of Luck strike with it and burn it.
status-Evade = Evade
status-Evade-help = The next blow a foe aims at you misses. Never more than one Evade.
status-Charm = Charmed
status-Charm-help = This foe's next blow falls on another foe.
status-Flattery = Flattered
status-Flattery-help = Lisa's next attack on this foe is twice as strong.

kw-Marked = Marked
kw-Marked-help = The number falls when the card comes to hand, and is seen ahead.
kw-Range = Number by chance
kw-Range-help = In place of "?" a number falls by chance between the ends shown in hand. A marked card throws it when it comes to hand; a blind one when played. Every such card played gives Ivan 1 Luck.
kw-LuckCard = Card of Luck
kw-LuckCard-help = Falls on a random target: a foe or one of the party. Its power is the Luck; once played, the Luck burns to 0.
kw-Forged = Forge mark
kw-Forged-help = At the start of the turn 2 cards in Kuzma's hand get the mark. A marked card played adds 1 to the plate. Once it leaves the hand, the mark is gone.
kw-Reforge = Reforge Strength
kw-Reforge-help = The foe loses that much Strength for the rest of the fight, and a random hero (Kuzma too) gains as much for the rest of the fight.
kw-UpgradeFight = Upgrade for the fight
kw-UpgradeFight-help = The card is upgraded until this fight ends.
kw-Bracers = Bracers
kw-Bracers-help = During the coming enemy turn the ally cannot lose an arm.
kw-Transmute = Reforge
kw-Transmute-help = A curse or status becomes a random card of its owner.
kw-Alien = Borrowed
kw-Alien-help = A copy of someone else's card. Costs what the original does; gone once played and when the turn ends. The owner loses nothing.
kw-Stash = Stash
kw-Stash-help = Gold laid by. It comes back on the next floor with half as much again; on the last floor it becomes Strength.
kw-Borrow = Borrow
kw-Borrow-help = You get half the target's Strength, at least 2 (until the round ends), and half its block. The target loses nothing.

